res (`sqrP`) otherwise.","docLink":"./MPN/Dispatch.html#MPN.Dispatch.sqrPD","kind":"def","line":138,"name":"MPN.Dispatch.sqrPD","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Dispatch.lean#L138-L152"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Dispatch.html#MPN.Dispatch.isMulPD\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Dispatch</span>.<span class=\"name\">isMulPD</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A </span><span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">W</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray\">WordArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">F</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordFolds\">WordFolds</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">B</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Toom/Kernels.html#MPN.Toom.ToomBase\">Toom.ToomBase</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cfg</span> : <a href=\"./MPN/Dispatch.html#MPN.Dispatch.MulConfig\">MulConfig</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/FFT/Product.html#MPN.FFT.FFTOps.IsMulP\">FFT.FFTOps.IsMulP</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN/Dispatch.html#MPN.Dispatch.mulPD\">mulPD</a> <span class=\"fn\">cfg</span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN/Dispatch.html#MPN.Dispatch.isMulPD","kind":"theorem","line":122,"name":"MPN.Dispatch.isMulPD","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Dispatch.lean#L122-L136"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Dispatch.html#MPN.Dispatch.mulPD\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Dispatch</span>.<span class=\"name\">mulPD</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A </span><span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">W</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray\">WordArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">F</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordFolds\">WordFolds</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">B</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Toom/Kernels.html#MPN.Toom.ToomBase\">Toom.ToomBase</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cfg</span> : <a href=\"./MPN/Dispatch.html#MPN.Dispatch.MulConfig\">MulConfig</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">A</span> → <span class=\"fn\">A</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\">A</span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The pointwise products of an FFT with `d` levels of recursion below it, like GMP's `mpn_mul_fft`\non its residues: the full product of two residues of `n + 1` limbs by the FFT itself, from\n`mulFFT` limbs, with `d - 1` levels below it, reduced afterwards like the Toom products; the Toom\nmethods (`mulP`) at depth `0`, below `mulFFT` limbs, or when the parameters do not suit the sizes.\nGMP multiplies its residues modulo `2ᴺ + 1` directly, by a negacyclic transform of half the size;\nthe full product costs about twice that, so the threshold is `mulFFT` itself.","docLink":"./MPN/Dispatch.html#MPN.Dispatch.mulPD","kind":"def","line":103,"name":"MPN.Dispatch.mulPD","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Dispatch.lean#L103-L120"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Dispatch.html#MPN.Dispatch.fftDepth\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Dispatch</span>.<span class=\"name\">fftDepth</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The depth of the FFT's recursion on its pointwise products: an FFT's residues of `n + 1` limbs\nhave about `0.6 √T` limbs for a product of `T` limbs, so two levels reach products far beyond\nmemory.","docLink":"./MPN/Dispatch.html#MPN.Dispatch.fftDepth","kind":"def","line":96,"name":"MPN.Dispatch.fftDepth","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Dispatch.lean#L96-L101"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Dispatch.html#MPN.Dispatch.isSqrP\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Dispatch</span>.<span class=\"name\">isSqrP</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A </span><span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">W</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray\">WordArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">F</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordFolds\">WordFolds</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">B</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Toom/Kernels.html#MPN.Toom.ToomBase\">Toom.ToomBase</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cfg</span> : <a href=\"./MPN/Toom/Ops.html#MPN.Toom.Config\">Toom.Config</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/FFT/Product.html#MPN.FFT.FFTOps.IsSqrP\">FFT.FFTOps.IsSqrP</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN/Dispatch.html#MPN.Dispatch.sqrP\">sqrP</a> <span class=\"fn\">cfg</span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN/Dispatch.html#MPN.Dispatch.isSqrP","kind":"theorem","line":90,"name":"MPN.Dispatch.isSqrP","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Dispatch.lean#L90-L94"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Dispatch.html#MPN.Dispatch.sqrP\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Dispatch</span>.<span class=\"name\">sqrP</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A </span><span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">W</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray\">WordArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"f